# Optional environment-file setup.
#
# Most people should leave this file alone and enter API keys on the in-app
# Settings page: http://127.0.0.1:3000/settings
#
# To use .env.local instead, copy this file to .env.local and uncomment the
# values you need. `.env.local` is gitignored and read only by the server.
# Changes to `.env.local` require restarting `npm run dev`.
#
# With no key at all, the app runs in offline mock mode.

# Optional: force a default engine (openrouter, elevenlabs, gemini, mock).
# The Settings page can also set this without a restart.
# STT_PROVIDER=openrouter

# OpenRouter — recommended for Cantonese/English/Bengali and code-switching.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=microsoft/mai-transcribe-2

# ElevenLabs Scribe v2 — good for English and long files.
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=sk_...

# Google Gemini 3.5 Transcribe.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=...
